5% faster per stack.Increased sticky grenade throw speed / unequip speed","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-16T00:13:53Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183783084","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3839680-1839041357022729","game_id":"steam-3839680","kind":"announcement","title":"BLIGHTFALL Playtest is Live!","summary":"The first wave of BLIGHTFALL Playtest invitations has been sent out!I'll be inviting more players regularly as I improve the game and fix issues.If you've been accepted, I'd love to hear your feedback on gameplay, balance, performance, and any bugs you encounter.Join the Discord to report bugs, share feedback, and suggest features you'd like to see added!https://discord.gg/bxQx4j58VqIf you haven't requested access yet, you can do so from the store page. More invitations will be sent out soon.Tha","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-22T00:12:47Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357022729","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:53:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3839680":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:00:48Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:00:48Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3839680":"2026-10-26T11:00:48Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"3839680":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:00:48Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T11:00:48Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:00:48Z"},"4965930":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:00:48Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T11:00:48Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:00:48Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"st